<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Speciality Care started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Speciality Care started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analysts Greg Wilson and Chris Russ initiated coverage of Speciality Care Network Inc with a buy rating, putting a 12-month price target of $13 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 to 8-5/8.</p>
